drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='A customer is reading a book near\nthe shelf.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,0.000\,3.240)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='一位顧客正在書架附近看書。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,0.000\,3.240)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The display has no books on the\nshelves.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,3.640\,6.688)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='顯示幕上的書架上沒有書籍。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,3.640\,6.688)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The bookstore is crowded with\npatrons.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,7.088\,10.064)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='書店裡擠滿了顧客。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,7.088\,10.064)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The woman is checking a label on a\nbook cover.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,10.464\,13.752)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='這位女士正在檢查一本書封面上的標籤。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,10.464\,13.752)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='You just released a new movie,\ndidn\'t you?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,14.152\,17.248)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='你剛發行了一部新電影，不是嗎？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,14.152\,17.248)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Yes, it came out very recently.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,17.648\,20.600)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='是的，它最近才出來。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,17.648\,20.600)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The painting is on display at the\nmuseum.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,21.000\,24.048)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='這幅畫正在博物館展出。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,21.000\,24.048)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='It will go up for auction this\nweek.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,24.448\,27.208)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='它將於本週進行拍賣。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,24.448\,27.208)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='When will the marathon be taking\nplace?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,27.608\,30.536)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='馬拉鬆比賽什麼時候舉辦？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,27.608\,30.536)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='It\'s being held in March.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,30.936\,33.264)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='它於三月舉行。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,30.936\,33.264)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='I\'ve never run a marathon.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,33.664\,36.040)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='我從來沒有跑過馬拉松。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,33.664\,36.040)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='It took place a year ago.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,36.440\,38.744)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='事情發生在一年前。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,36.440\,38.744)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='How much of the concert proceeds\nare going to charity?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,39.144\,42.528)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='演唱會的收益有多少會捐給慈善機構？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,39.144\,42.528)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The singer is proceeding\nbackstage.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,42.928\,45.832)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='歌手正在後台進行。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,42.928\,45.832)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='I believe it\'s about half of all\nproceeds.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,46.232\,49.352)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='我相信這大約是所有收益的一半。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,46.232\,49.352)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='She donates money to charity every\nChristmas.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,49.752\,53.208)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='她每年聖誕節都會捐款給慈善機構。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,49.752\,53.208)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Questions 59 to 61 refer to the\nfollowing conversation.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,53.608\,58.384)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='問題59至61涉及以下對話。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,53.608\,58.384)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The exhibition is set to open next\nweek. We\'ve been working on it for\nweeks and still haven\'t got\neverything ready.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,58.784\,66.368)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='該展覽定於下週開幕。我們已經為此工作了數週，\n但仍未準備好一切。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,58.784\,66.368)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The only major thing to take care\nof is getting the displays set up.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,66.768\,70.944)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='唯一需要注意的主要事情是設定顯示器。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,66.768\,70.944)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Yes, but finding a reliable mover\nwho can move so many different\ntypes of art safely is proving to\nbe difficult.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,71.344\,78.424)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='是的，但事實證明，找到一個可以安全搬運如此多\n不同類型藝術品的可靠搬運工是很困難的。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,71.344\,78.424)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='I understand that. Pietro\'s\nincorporation of various forms of\nmedia into one piece of art makes\nhis works unique, but incredibly\ndifficult to move.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,78.824\,89.144)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='我明白這一點。彼得羅將各種形式的媒體融入藝術\n作品中，這使得他的作品獨一無二，但又極其難以\n移動。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,78.824\,89.144)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='I really don\'t know who we should\nturn to.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,89.544\,92.256)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='我真的不知道我們該向誰求助。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,89.544\,92.256)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Maybe try talking to Betty in\nAcquisitions. She\'s had lots of\nexperience with unusual pieces in\nexhibitions.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,92.656\,100.552)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='也許嘗試與收購部門的貝蒂交談。她對於展覽中不\n尋常的作品有著豐富的經驗。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,92.656\,100.552)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='That\'s a great idea. I can\'t\nbelieve I didn\'t think of that\nmyself. Thanks!':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,100.952\,107.576)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='這是個好主意。我不敢相信我自己沒有想到這一點\n。謝謝！':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,100.952\,107.576)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='When will the exhibition be taking\nplace?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,107.976\,111.072)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='展覽什麼時候舉行？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,107.976\,111.072)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='In two days':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,111.472\,113.392)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='兩天後':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,111.472\,113.392)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='In one week':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,113.792\,115.640)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='一星期內':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,113.792\,115.640)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='In two weeks':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,116.040\,117.936)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='兩週後':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,116.040\,117.936)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='In a few days':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,118.336\,120.304)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='幾天後':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,118.336\,120.304)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Why is the woman looking for a\nspecific service?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,120.704\,124.040)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='該女士為何尋求特定服務？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,120.704\,124.040)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='She doesn\'t have experience moving\ndisplay pieces.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,124.440\,128.112)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='她沒有移動展示品的經驗。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,124.440\,128.112)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='There are multiple forms of art to\nmove.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,128.512\,131.536)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='有多種形式的藝術可供移動。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,128.512\,131.536)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The last moving company has\nclosed.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,131.936\,134.936)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='最後一家搬家公司已經關門了。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,131.936\,134.936)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Their current movers are having\nvehicle trouble.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,135.336\,138.576)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='他們目前的搬運工遇到了車輛問題。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,135.336\,138.576)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='What does the man recommend?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,138.976\,141.328)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='男人有什麼推薦？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,138.976\,141.328)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='That the woman moves everything\nherself.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,141.728\,144.824)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='女人自己移動一切。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,141.728\,144.824)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The woman should speak with a\ncoworker.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,145.224\,148.056)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='該名女士應與同事交談。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,145.224\,148.056)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The woman should talk to the\nartist about it.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,148.456\,151.480)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='女人應該和藝術家談談這件事。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,148.456\,151.480)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='That the woman speaks with their\nprevious movers.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,151.880\,155.216)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='該名女子與他們之前的搬家者交談過。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,151.880\,155.216)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Questions 80 to 82 refer to the\nfollowing phone call.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,155.616\,159.816)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='問題80至82涉及以下電話。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,155.616\,159.816)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Hey, Frank. It\'s Gary. I just\nheard that the Rock Forever\nConcert next week has been\ncanceled.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,160.216\,168.328)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='嘿，弗蘭克。是加里。我剛剛聽說下週的\nRock Forever 演唱會取消了。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,160.216\,168.328)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Apparently, there was a pretty bad\nlightning storm last week near the\nstadium it was being held in and\nthe electrical system was damaged.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,168.728\,176.792)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='顯然，上週舉辦比賽的體育場附近發生了一場相當\n嚴重的雷暴，電力系統遭到損壞。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,168.728\,176.792)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The concert has been postponed\nuntil they can repair the wiring.\nI called the ticket company, and\nnow we have two choices.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,177.192\,185.256)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='音樂會已推遲，直到他們能修復線路為止。我打電\n話給票務公司，現在我們有兩個選擇。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,177.192\,185.256)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='We can either get full refunds on\nour tickets or we can hold onto\nthem and wait until a new date for\nthe concert is announced.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,185.656\,192.688)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='我們可以獲得門票的全額退款，也可以保留門票並\n等待音樂會的新日期公佈。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,185.656\,192.688)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='If we wait, then when the concert\nhas been rescheduled, we can get\ntwo free drinks from the drink\nstand. Let me know what you want\nto do.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,193.088\,201.584)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='如果我們等待，那麼當音樂會改期時，我們可以從\n飲料攤得到兩杯免費飲料。讓我知道你想做什麼。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,193.088\,201.584)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='What happened last week?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,201.984\,204.264)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='上週發生了什麼事？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,201.984\,204.264)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The city was hit by a snowstorm.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,204.664\,207.400)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='這座城市遭受了暴風雪的襲擊。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,204.664\,207.400)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='There was a large storm.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,207.800\,210.032)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='發生了一場大風暴。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,207.800\,210.032)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='There was a severe earthquake.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,210.432\,212.880)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='發生了強烈地震。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,210.432\,212.880)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='An outbreak of a new virus.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,213.280\,215.800)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='一種新病毒的爆發。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,213.280\,215.800)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Why has the concert been delayed?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,216.200\,218.720)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='演唱會為何延期？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,216.200\,218.720)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='New speakers are being installed.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,219.120\,221.760)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='正在安裝新揚聲器。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,219.120\,221.760)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The seating was damaged in the\nstadium.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,222.160\,225.112)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='體育場內的座位損壞。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,222.160\,225.112)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Lightning damaged the power grid.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,225.512\,228.224)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='雷電損壞了電網。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,225.512\,228.224)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The lead singer came down with a\ncold.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,228.624\,231.528)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='主唱得了感冒。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,228.624\,231.528)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='What does the speaker mean when he\nsays "Let me know what you want to\ndo."?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,231.928\,236.152)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='當說話者說「讓我知道你想做什麼」時，他的意思\n是什麼？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,231.928\,236.152)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='His friend should call the ticket\ncompany.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,236.552\,239.504)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='他的朋友應該打電話給票務公司。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,236.552\,239.504)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='He wants his friend to make a\ndecision.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,239.904\,242.760)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='他希望他的朋友做出決定。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,239.904\,242.760)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='He is asking if his friend has\nsome free time.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,243.160\,246.592)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='他問他的朋友是否有空閒時間。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,243.160\,246.592)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='He is curious about their plans\nfor the night.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,246.992\,250.280)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='他很好奇他們今晚的計劃。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,246.992\,250.280)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Critics believed that the actress\nshould have been nominated for\noutstanding performance because of\nher role in her latest movie.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,250.680\,257.616)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='評論家認為，這位女演員應該因為她在最新電影中\n的角色而獲得出色表演提名。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,250.680\,257.616)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='she':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,258.016\,259.480)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='她':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,258.016\,259.480)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='her':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,259.880\,261.248)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='她':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,259.880\,261.248)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='herself':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,261.648\,263.328)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='她自己':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,261.648\,263.328)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='hers':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,263.728\,265.216)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='她的':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,263.728\,265.216)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Due to the high numbers of online\nsubscriptions and low sales of\nprinted media, the publication\nshifted to a purely digital\nformat.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,265.616\,273.824)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='由於線上訂閱量高而印刷媒體銷量低，該出版物轉\n向純數位格式。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,265.616\,273.824)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Due to':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,274.224\,275.760)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='由於':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,274.224\,275.760)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Ahead of':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,276.160\,277.768)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='領先於':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,276.160\,277.768)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Regardless of':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,278.168\,280.160)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='不管':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,278.168\,280.160)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='In opposition to':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,280.560\,282.576)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='反對':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,280.560\,282.576)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Metro Gallery to Hold Pierre\nCousteau Exhibition':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,282.976\,286.696)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='大都會畫廊將舉辦皮耶·庫斯托展覽':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,282.976\,286.696)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='by Marjorie Beckham':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,287.096\,289.208)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='瑪喬麗貝克漢':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,287.096\,289.208)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The Metro Gallery, located near\nCity Hall, is set to hold an\nexhibition of various works from\nrenowned artist Pierre Cousteau.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,289.608\,297.696)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='位於市政廳附近的都會畫廊將舉辦著名藝術家皮耶\n·庫斯託的各種作品展。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,289.608\,297.696)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Representatives from the Metro\nGallery said they are highly\nenthusiastic to be given the\nopportunity to display many of his\nworks of art, both new and old.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,298.096\,307.096)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='大都會畫廊的代表表示，他們非常高興有機會展示\n他的許多新舊藝術作品。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,298.096\,307.096)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Originally from\nRochefort-en-Terre, Mr. Cousteau\nbegan to gain acclaim with his\nvivid landscape paintings in the\nrealist style.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,307.496\,315.272)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='庫斯托先生來自泰爾地區羅什福爾，他以寫實風格\n的生動風景畫開始贏得讚譽。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,307.496\,315.272)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Said to be able to capture even\nthe smallest of details, Mr.\nCousteau quickly rose to\nprominence.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,315.672\,322.200)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='據說庫斯托先生甚至能夠捕捉最微小的細節，因此\n很快就聲名鵲起。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,315.672\,322.200)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='His earliest works have been known\nto fetch upwards of twenty million\ndollars when put up for auction.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,322.600\,328.552)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='據了解，他最早的作品在拍賣時售價高達兩千萬美\n元。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,322.600\,328.552)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='After becoming a household name in\nhis native France, Mr. Cousteau\nlater moved to the United States\nwhere he began to dabble in other\nforms of artistic expression.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,328.952\,338.648)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='庫斯托先生在祖國法國家喻戶曉後，移居美國，開\n始涉足其他形式的藝術表現。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,328.952\,338.648)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='His work with marble, while\noriginally not as popular as his\npaintings, quickly gained fame\nonce he began to create sculptures\nusing abstract styling.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,339.048\,348.408)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='他的大理石作品雖然最初不如他的繪畫那麼受歡迎\n，但一旦他開始使用抽象風格創作雕塑，就迅速聲\n名鵲起。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,339.048\,348.408)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Having recently finished an\nextensive renovation that replaced\nan aging electrical system and\nwater drainage system,':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,348.808\,355.936)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='最近完成了大規模翻新，更換了老化的電力系統和\n排水系統，':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,348.808\,355.936)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='as well as overhauling its\nappearance, the Metro Gallery\nreopened to the public earlier\nthis month.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,356.336\,362.336)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='除了徹底改變外觀外，大都會畫廊在本月初也重新\n向公眾開放。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,356.336\,362.336)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Originally constructed in the\nearly 1900s, the Metro Gallery\nbegan to fall into disrepair in\nthe late 1980s.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,362.736\,370.848)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='大都會畫廊最初建於 1900 年代初，但在\n1980 年代末開始年久失修。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,362.736\,370.848)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='A lack of high-profile artists and\nworks, in addition to cut funding\nto maintain its appearance led to\na decrease in patronage.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,371.248\,379.048)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='缺乏知名藝術家和作品，加上削減資金以維持其外\n觀，導致贊助量減少。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,371.248\,379.048)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='However, the city government\nrecently stepped in to provide the\nhistoric building with new funding\nin order to preserve the building\nand restore it to its former\nglory.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,379.448\,388.472)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='然而，市政府最近介入，為這座歷史建築提供了新\n的資金，以保護這座建築並恢復其昔日的輝煌。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,379.448\,388.472)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Now officially recognized as a\nheritage site, funding for the\nMetro Gallery has been secured for\nthe next thirty years,':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,388.872\,396.504)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='現在正式認定為遺產地，大都會畫廊在未來三十年\n的資金已得到保障，':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,388.872\,396.504)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='allowing it to host the works of\nfamous artists, like Mr. Cousteau.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,396.904\,401.704)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='使其能夠展出庫斯托先生等著名藝術家的作品。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,396.904\,401.704)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='With a restored look to carry it\nforward into the twenty-first\ncentury,':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,402.104\,406.616)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='以修復的面貌帶入二十一世紀，':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,402.104\,406.616)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='the Metro Gallery now makes for\nthe perfect venue for the\nbreath-taking and awe-inspiring\nworks of Pierre Cousteau.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,407.016\,413.664)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='現在，Metro 畫廊成為展示皮埃爾·庫斯托\n(Pierre Cousteau)\n令人嘆為觀止、令人驚嘆的作品的完美場所。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,407.016\,413.664)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='What is this article mainly about?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,414.064\,416.752)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='這篇文章主要在講什麼？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,414.064\,416.752)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='An art museum that is closing\ndown.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,417.152\,420.128)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='即將關閉的藝術博物館。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,417.152\,420.128)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='An exhibition being held by a\ngallery.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,420.528\,423.672)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='畫廊正在舉辦的展覽。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,420.528\,423.672)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='An artist trying to regain his\nfame.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,424.072\,427.024)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='一位試圖恢復名譽的藝術家。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,424.072\,427.024)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='A city trying to repair an old\nbuilding.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,427.424\,430.400)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='一座試圖修復舊建築的城市。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,427.424\,430.400)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='What is implied about Pierre\nCousteau?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,430.800\,433.680)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='皮埃爾·庫斯托暗示了什麼？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,430.800\,433.680)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='He uses multiple forms of media\nfor his art.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,434.080\,437.560)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='他在他的藝術中使用多種形式的媒體。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,434.080\,437.560)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='He originally gained fame for his\nstylistic designs.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,437.960\,441.824)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='他最初因其風格設計而聞名。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,437.960\,441.824)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='He is from the United States and\nmoved to France.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,442.224\,445.776)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='他來自美國，移居法國。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,442.224\,445.776)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='His sculptures never became\npopular.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,446.176\,449.224)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='他的雕塑從未流行起來。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,446.176\,449.224)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='According to the article, why did\nthe gallery need to be remodeled?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,449.624\,453.848)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='根據文章所述，為什麼畫廊需要改造？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,449.624\,453.848)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='People complained about the\nconfusing layout.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,454.248\,457.512)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='人們抱怨佈局混亂。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,454.248\,457.512)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='It was damaged by a recent natural\ndisaster.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,457.912\,461.440)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='它因最近的自然災害而受損。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,457.912\,461.440)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='It was showing its age due to lack\nof money.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,461.840\,464.984)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='由於缺錢，它已經顯得很老舊了。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,461.840\,464.984)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Vandals painted the exterior of\nthe building.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,465.384\,468.624)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='破壞者粉刷了建築物的外部。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,465.384\,468.624)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='In which of the following\npositions marked [1], [2],[3], and\n[4] does the following sentence\nbest belong?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,469.024\,477.664)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='以下句子最適合標記為 [1]、[2]、[3]\n和 [4] 的位置中的哪一個？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,469.024\,477.664)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='"Said to be able to capture even\nthe smallest of details, Mr.\nCousteau quickly rose to\nprominence."':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,478.064\,484.592)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='“據說庫斯托先生甚至能夠捕捉到最微小的細節，\n他很快就聲名鵲起。”':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,478.064\,484.592)'